msgid ""
"Oh, you know. I have a lot of practice from when I was a kid. Anyway, you're"
" the last one. Let's go meet up with the others."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "316"
msgid "Well, I found everybody. Did you all enjoy yourselves?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "328"
msgid "Yeah! I thought we made it pretty tough for you, but I guess not."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "340"
msgid "I dunno... I thought it was kinda boring."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "352"
msgid "Hm? What's wrong, Izumi?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "364"
msgid ""
"(She's all bent outta shape because you didn't find her last. I told you!)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "376"
msgid "(Oh, yeah... Sorry about that.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "388"
msgid ""
"But it was fun playing together, Uncle Kaz. Let's do this again sometime!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "400"
